Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 13:58:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] trace: v2 instrumentation hooks in clip/cost/mcts/process

Record clip oracle decisions, MCTS transitions, cost evaluations,
and decomposition state. Build config links zlib for crc32.
